= ```scala fuel
= compile
= errors show
- ##
+ ##

- document.getElementByld(t"heading")
+ document.getElementByld(t"heading")

= document.getElementByld(t"heading")
- ```
+ ```

- So is an argument of the wrong type:
+ Lo stesso vale per un argomento del tipo sbagliato:

= So is an argument of the wrong type:
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= So is an argument of the wrong type:
